@round2_results
go-to: kornilov_wins if kornilov_plurality == 1; kalinin_wins if kalinin_plurality == 1; maisky_wins if maisky_plurality == 1; leuchtenberg_wins if leuchtenberg_plurality == 1


@kornilov_wins
on-arrival: president = "Kornilov"
face-image: img/kornilovwins.jpg

As expected, the incumbent Kornilov wins the presidency. Let's hope he continues to keep the Solidarists out of power.

@kalinin_wins
on-arrival: president = "Kalinin"; rkp_relation = 80;

Mikhail Kalinin of the RKP has won the presidency. Immediately, the far-right launches a coup attempt against the government. We have no choice but to unite with the RKP against the Solidarists...

- @civil_war: This is civil war.

@leuchtenberg_wins
on-arrival: president = nts_candidate; chancellor = "Leuchtenberg"; chancellor_party = "NTS"
face-image: img/badending.jpg

[? if nts_candidate == "Leuchtenberg" : Sergey Leuchtenberg of the NTS has won the presidency. He wastes no time in consolidating power. ?]
[? if nts_candidate != "Leuchtenberg" : The NTS candidate [+ president +] has won. The first action President [+ president +] takes is inviting Leuchtenberg back into Germany, and appointing him chancellor. The Solidarists waste no time in consolidating power. ?]

- @leuchtenberg_takes_power: What do we do now?


@maisky_wins
on-arrival: president = "Maisky"; reformist_dissent -= 15; center_dissent -= 15; labor_dissent -= 15; left_dissent -= 5; workers_rsdrp += 8*(1-dissent); old_middle_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); new_middle_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); unemployed_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent);
face-image: img/maiskywins.jpg

Ivan Maisky of the RSDRP has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, and his victory is able to bolster our support.
